  LegalSection(
    "6. Security & Data Retention",
    "All communication between the app and our servers is encrypted in transit (HTTPS/TLS). Account data is stored with Google Cloud, which encrypts it at rest, behind security rules that let only the signed-in owner read or change their own record. No system is perfectly secure, but we work to protect your data.\n\nWe keep your data only as long as your account exists. When you delete it, your record is removed from our servers right away; copies in the provider's backups are overwritten on their normal schedule. Guest data stays on your phone until you delete the app or clear its data. Emails you send to support are kept only as long as needed to help you.",
